    "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtext>P</mtext><mo>-</mo><mtext>V</mtext></math>&nbsp;plots for two gases during adiabatic processes are shown in the figure. Plots <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn></math> should correspond respectively to<br />\r<br />\r<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/6065.JPG\" style=\"width: 220px; height: 179px;\" />",
    "image": null
  },
